      "field_name": "diagnostic_criteria",
      "value": "progressive stiffness and rigidity of the axial muscles; slow progression of stiffness to include proximal limb musculature; hyperlordosis; superimposed episodic spasms precipitated by movement, noise, or emotional stress; normal intellect; normal motor and sensory examinations; typical electromyogram (EMG) findings; positive response to benzodiazepines",
